## Testing Migrations

### Update Test Configuration
```typescript
// Before
TestBed.configureTestingModule({
  declarations: [Component],
  imports: [Module]
});

// After (Standalone)
TestBed.configureTestingModule({
  imports: [Component] // Component is standalone
});
```

## Common Issues and Solutions

### Issue: Module Not Found
```bash
# Solution: Update imports
# Old: import { Module } from '@angular/common';
# New: import { CommonModule } from '@angular/common';
```

### Issue: Deprecated APIs
```typescript
// Check Angular deprecation guide
// Replace deprecated APIs with new ones
```

### Issue: Build Errors
```bash
# Clear cache and rebuild
rm -rf node_modules .angular
npm install
ng build
```

